flowchart TD
    Start([New Tool Call]) --> M1[M1: Data Foundation]
    M1 --> M2[M2: Action Normalization]
    M2 --> M3[M3: Behavioral Sequence]
    M3 --> M4[M4: Feature Extraction]
    
    M4 --> M5{M5: ML Risk \n Evaluation}
    M1 --> M6{M6: Task \n Authorization}
    
    %% M5 Path
    M5 -->|Exception| FailSafe[Fail-Safe: BLOCK]
    M5 -->|Prob < Threshold| LowRisk(Risk: LOW)
    M5 -->|Prob >= Threshold| HighRisk(Risk: HIGH)
    
    %% M6 Path
    M6 -->|Context Match| AuthPass(Auth: PASS)
    M6 -->|Out of Scope| AuthFail(Auth: DENY)
    
    LowRisk --> M7[M7: Policy Fusion Engine]
    HighRisk --> M7
    AuthPass --> M7
    AuthFail --> M7
    
    %% M7 Decision
    M7 -->|Check Explicit Policies| M7Pol{Policies Match?}
    M7Pol -->|Deny| Block(BLOCK)
    M7Pol -->|Alert| Alert(ALERT)
    M7Pol -->|None| Baseline{Baseline Matrix}
    
    Baseline -->|Risk: HIGH| Block
    Baseline -->|Auth: DENY| Block
    Baseline -->|Risk: LOW & Auth: PASS| Allow(ALLOW)
    
    Block --> Interceptor[M8: Runtime Interceptor]
    Alert --> Interceptor
    Allow --> Interceptor
    FailSafe --> Interceptor
